  <para style="mt">ƁATAKURU PUULUSA HAA E FILIMUUNU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Immorde e an min Puulusa, oo kasoojo sabu Iisaa Almasiihu on, wondude e Timotee oo musiɗɗo men, haa e oo giɗo amen, wondiɗɗo amen e golle, ɗun ko an Filimuunu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wondude e Apifiyyata oo bandiraawo amen e Arkiipe oo wondiɗɗo amen e tippiro e haa e *moftal wongal ngal ka suudu maa an Filimuunu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yo moƴƴere e ɓuttu wonan on, immorde e Alla Baaba men, e Iisaa Almasiihu Joomi on.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Puulusa Weltorani Alla fii Filimuunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Miɗo duumii e jarnugol Alla an on e nder ko mi maandini fii maa e nder torndeeji an ɗin, <verse number="5" style="v"/>ko fii miɗo nanude no wowlee fii ko gomɗinɗaa Iisaa Joomi on kon, e giggol ngol yiɗuɗaa yimɓe Alla ɓen fow ngol kadi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mi torike yo gomɗinal maa ngal hawtuɗen ngal waɗu batte, andaa moƴƴere wonannde en e nder humondiral e *Almasiihu on. <verse number="7" style="v"/>E hoore ɗun mi heɓii weltaare e wakkilaare buy sabu giggol maa ngol, ko fii ko sabu maa yo musiɗɗo, ɓerɗe yimɓe Alla ɓen ɓuttiniraa.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Puulusa Fattorani Onesiima ka Filimuunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi, fii kala miɗo mari hoolaare mawnde sabu Almasiihu on fii windangol ma ko haanuɗaa waɗude kon, <verse number="9" style="v"/>miɗo yiɗu-maa tororde giggol, wano min Puulusa mi woniri nii nayeejo e kasoojo kadi sabu Iisaa Almasiihu on. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mi jeejii ma fii Onesiima, on wontuɗo ɓiɗɗo an ka gomɗinal fewndo mi jolkaa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hari o wonanii ma meere, kono jooni o nafete wano o nafirimmi non.<note caller="a" style="f">1.11 <char style="it">«Onesiima»</char> ko firi ko <char style="it">«nafa».</char> </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Awa mi neltii mo e maa, on mo tawata ko ɓernde an min tigi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mi faalano yo o wonu takko an, fii yo o wallan lonto-maa e nder ko mi jolkaa fii Kibaaru Moƴƴo on kon. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kono hay fus mi faalaaka waɗude e ɓaawo fewjoore maa nden, fii wota kuuɗe maa moƴƴe ɗen wonu karhaaɗe, kono ɗe wona anniyaaɗe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>No gasa a seeduno e Onesiima haa seeɗa, fii yo a hettitu mo haa poomaa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hara hinaa wa maccuɗo hande kadi, kono no ɓuriri maccuɗo, wa musiɗɗo yiɗaaɗo, tentinii telen-ma an min, ittii e sikke telen-ma maa, ɓay ko o maccuɗo, awa kadi ko o musiɗɗo gomɗinɗo Joomi on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Si tawii hiɗa jogori lan wa gollideteeɗo, haray jaɓir mo wa an min. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Si himo bonnu-maa, maa si himo jogani-maa goɗɗun, fawu ɗun e hoore an. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ko jungo an ngon tigi, min Puulusa mi windiri nduu ɓatakuru, mi yoɓitoyte ɗun, fii kala mi faalaaka wi'ude an tigi hiɗa joganii mi goɗɗun, ɗun ko ngurndan maa ɗan. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Awa yo musiɗɗo, waɗanan ɗun sabu Joomiraaɗo on, ɓuttinaa ɓernde an nden e telen-ma Almasiihu on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ko e nder hoolorgol ɗoftaare maa nden mi windiri, e hoore andugol a waɗay ɓuri ko mi wi'i kon. <verse number="22" style="v"/>E hoore ɗun, eɓɓanan werde, miɗo tanƴinii yahugol ka mon sabu torndeeji mon ɗin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Epafaraasi oo mo mi sokidaa ka kaso sabu Iisaa Almasiihu on, salminii ma, <verse number="24" style="v"/>wondude e Markuusa e Aristarke e Demaasi e Luuka, ɗun ko ɓen wondiɓɓe an e golle.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yo moƴƴere Iisaa Almasiihu Joomi men on wonu e ɓerɗe mon.</para>
</usx>
